Z||000009||Raydar||08-11-2001||10:46 PM||||Chevy Avalanche<BR>Pontiac Aztek<P>Why does GM keep introducing new models that look like toolsheds? Yeesh!<P>I like the new Mustangs. Especially the new dark metallic gray color. Seems that with the newer body style of the last two years (lots of sharp angles) people either really like it or really don't.<P>I find the Jeep Liberty much less offensive than the Aztek.<BR>IMHO, Ford Excursions are just too freaking big to be taken seriously. Strangely enough, I've only seen 4-5 of them on the road since their introduction. Fortunately.<BR>I place the Escalade in the same category. Have only seen two. First one was black, and had like 20" rims on it. A $40,000+ rebadged Blazer pimpmobile.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT><p>[This message has been edited by Raydar (edited 08-11-2001).]||||reg||1
